{
  "id": "smart-risk-score",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "name": "SMART2 Risk Score (10-Year Recurrent Vascular Event Risk)",
    "short_name": "SMART2",
    "aliases": ["SMART risk score", "Secondary prevention MACE"],
    "subspecialties": ["Stroke", "Other"],
    "kind": "formula",
    "summary": "Estimates 10-year risk of recurrent myocardial infarction, stroke, or vascular death in patients aged 40–80 with established atherosclerotic disease (CAD, CeVD, PAD, and/or AAA).",
    "time_estimate": "~2 min",
    "clinical_pearls": [
      "Requires at least one manifest atherosclerotic disease location (coronary, cerebrovascular, peripheral arterial, or abdominal aortic aneurysm).",
      "Uses the updated SMART2 algorithm (Hageman et al., Eur Heart J 2022) with competing-risk and geographic E/O recalibration across 369,044 external validation patients.",
      "Pitfall — Modest discrimination & regional variation: C-statistics in secondary prevention cohorts vary (~0.60–0.77), and regional recalibration intercepts may not capture local healthcare disparities or modern intensive GDMT (PCSK9i, SGLT2i) lowering contemporary event rates.",
      "Pitfall — Non-European 10-year extrapolation: True 10-year follow-up in external validation was strongest in European cohorts; non-European 10-year projections rely partially on shorter-horizon extrapolation."
    ]
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "kind": "select",
      "id": "region",
      "label": "Geographic Risk Region",
      "required": true,
      "options": [
        { "id": "europe_low", "label": "Europe — Low risk", "points": 0 },
        { "id": "europe_moderate", "label": "Europe — Moderate risk", "points": 1 },
        { "id": "europe_high", "label": "Europe — High risk", "points": 2 },
        { "id": "europe_very_high", "label": "Europe — Very high risk", "points": 3 },
        { "id": "asia", "label": "Asia (excluding Japan)", "points": 4 },
        { "id": "north_america", "label": "North America", "points": 5 },
        { "id": "latin_america", "label": "Latin America", "points": 6 },
        { "id": "australia", "label": "Australia", "points": 7 },
        { "id": "japan", "label": "Japan", "points": 8 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "numeric",
      "id": "age",
      "label": "Age",
      "required": true,
      "canonical_unit": "years",
      "units": [{ "unit": "years", "label": "years", "to_canonical_factor": 1 }],
      "min_canonical": 40,
      "max_canonical": 80,
      "step": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "select",
      "id": "sex",
      "label": "Biological Sex",
      "required": true,
      "options": [
        { "id": "female", "label": "Female", "points": 0, "badge": "F" },
        { "id": "male", "label": "Male", "points": 1, "badge": "M" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "select",
      "id": "smoker",
      "label": "Current Smoking",
      "required": true,
      "options": [
        { "id": "no", "label": "No", "points": 0 },
        { "id": "yes", "label": "Yes", "points": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "select",
      "id": "diabetes",
      "label": "Diabetes Mellitus",
      "required": true,
      "options": [
        { "id": "no", "label": "No", "points": 0 },
        { "id": "yes", "label": "Yes", "points": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "numeric",
      "id": "sbp",
      "label": "Systolic Blood Pressure",
      "required": true,
      "canonical_unit": "mmHg",
      "units": [{ "unit": "mmHg", "label": "mmHg", "to_canonical_factor": 1 }],
      "min_canonical": 70,
      "max_canonical": 220,
      "step": 1
    },
    {
      "kind": "numeric",
      "id": "total_chol",
      "label": "Total Cholesterol",
      "required": true,
      "canonical_unit": "mmol/L",
      "units": [
        { "unit": "mmol/L", "label": "mmol/L", "to_canonical_factor": 1 },
        { "unit": "mg/dL", "label": "mg/dL", "to_canonical_factor": 0.02586 }
      ],
      "min_canonical": 2.0,
      "max_canonical": 12.0,
      "step": 0.1
    },
    {
      "kind": "numeric",
      "id": "hdl_chol",
      "label": "HDL Cholesterol",
      "required": true,
      "canonical_unit": "mmol/L",
      "units": [
        { "unit": "mmol/L", "label": "mmol/L", "to_canonical_factor": 1 },
        { "unit": "mg/dL", "label": "mg/dL", "to_canonical_factor": 0.02586 }
